Package: nordicepimight
Title: Build EPIMIGHT's Cohort Table and Run It on Register Data
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Ryan", "Waples", email = "ryan.waples@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The functions behind the nordic-geno-epimight kit's steps: checking the
    pedigree and trait files, building EPIMIGHT's cohort table, running EPIMIGHT, and
    writing, summarizing and plotting its results. Installed by the kit's setup step;
    not meant for CRAN.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.5)
Imports: data.table, yaml, jsonlite, ggplot2, rmarkdown, epimight, pedigreegraph
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
